<h2>steps</h2>
<ul>
  <li class="step">add <code>class="step"</code> to anything</li>
  <li class="step">each → reveals the next one, in page order</li>
  <li class="step">← goes back; coming back from the next slide lands fully revealed</li>
  <li class="step">the url keeps your place: <code>#2.3</code> is slide 2, step 3</li>
</ul>
<aside class="notes">Keys: → / space / l / j next · ← / h / k back · g picker · f fullscreen · p presenter · home / end.</aside>
